@NotificationApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5142

### Version
GET {{NotificationApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Notification/version
Accept: application/json

### Send email via AWS SES
POST {{NotificationApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Notification/send-ses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "John Doe",
  "recipientEmail": "john@example.com",
  "subject": "Welcome!",
  "body": "<h1>Hello John</h1><p>Thanks for signing up.</p>"
}

### Send email via SMTP
POST {{NotificationApi_HostAddress}}/api/v1/Notification/send-smpt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "recipientName": "John Doe",
  "recipientEmail": "john@example.com",
  "subject": "Welcome!",
  "body": "<h1>Hello John</h1><p>Thanks for signing up.</p>"
}
